            "review_title": "Review at Stone Castle Cafe",
            "review_text": "Mirage T\n291 contributions\n0\nImpressive decoration and Nice food\nAug 2015 • Couples\nThe decoration will surely impressed you. From the time you step inside this cafe, you will definitely feel like you are in a european castle. Stone is the main material with lots of attention to details: statues, antique chairs, pictures, etc. Bring the camera along, you won't regret it.\nFood and drink have reasonable prices, honestly, i was thinking it supposed to be expensive due to the look of the cafe but it was not. Very reasonable!\nStaffs are friendly, i got lost on the way to the cafe but finally i could reach there thanks to the staffs' help through phone.\nYou can ask them to give you a tour around the cafe, they have 2 floors and still building more.\nLovely place, we had a wonderful time with good food. The only problem is it's quite far from the city center.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten February 5, 2016",
